# "... as long as they haven't dealt combat damage yet": only combat damage counts. Pyroclasm deals two to every
# creature (CR 120.3e) without targeting, so hexproof does not stop it, but the damage is noncombat and the hexproof stays:
# Bot2's Unsummon is still refused afterwards. "Yet" lasts the whole game, not one turn.

